<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>역곡지구 하우스토리 입찰 제안 세부현황서</title>

<style>
/* =========================================================
   01. RESET
========================================================= */

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family:
        "Pretendard",
        "Noto Sans KR",
        "Apple SD Gothic Neo",
        "Malgun Gothic",
        sans-serif;

    color: #26313d;
    line-height: 1.65;

    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 0%, rgba(142,180,230,.18), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 96% 8%, rgba(188,171,226,.14), transparent 32%),
        #eef2f7;

    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
}


/* =========================================================
   02. DESIGN TOKENS
========================================================= */

:root {
    --navy: #1f344d;
    --navy2: #304c6d;

    --blue: #5e8fc7;
    --blue-light: #eaf2fb;

    --lavender: #8b82c5;
    --lavender-light: #f0eef9;

    --mint: #4f9a8a;
    --mint-light: #e9f5f2;

    --gold: #ad8c55;
    --gold-light: #f6f0e6;

    --red: #b95e63;
    --red-light: #fbefef;

    --ink: #26313d;
    --muted: #697789;

    --line: #d8e0e9;
    --line-dark: #c3ced9;

    --soft: #f7f9fc;
    --paper: #ffffff;

    --radius-lg: 22px;
    --radius-md: 14px;
    --radius-sm: 9px;

    --shadow:
        0 18px 45px rgba(31,52,77,.08),
        0 3px 12px rgba(31,52,77,.04);
}


/* =========================================================
   03. TOOLBAR
========================================================= */

.toolbar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 999;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;

    padding: 12px 20px;

    background: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);

    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196,206,216,.75);
}

.toolbar-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
}

.toolbar-sub {
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
}

.toolbar-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
}

.toolbar button {
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 17px;

    border: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;

    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;

    cursor: pointer;

    transition:
        transform .15s ease,
        box-shadow .15s ease;
}

.btn-reset {
    color: #506174;
    background: #eef2f6;
}

.btn-print {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #335b86, #527eac);
    box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(51,91,134,.22);
}

.toolbar button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
}


/* =========================================================
   04. DOCUMENT LAYOUT
========================================================= */

.site-wrap {
    padding: 38px 20px 80px;
}

.document {
    width: min(1120px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
}


/* =========================================================
   05. COVER
========================================================= */

.cover {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;

    min-height: 760px;

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;

    padding: 74px 64px 56px;

    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(113,156,207,.22), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(146,132,196,.14), transparent 34%),
        #fff;

    border: 1px solid rgba(207,216,226,.92);
    border-radius: 28px;

    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.cover::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;

    width: 9px;
    height: 100%;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            180deg,
            #294b70,
            #6d95c1 52%,
            #948bc6
        );
}

.cover-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;

    width: fit-content;

    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding: 7px 13px;

    border: 1px solid #d6e0eb;
    border-radius: 999px;

    background: rgba(245,248,252,.9);

    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .08em;

    color: #607286;
}

.cover-kicker::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;

    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue);
}

.cover h1 {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;

    color: var(--navy);
}

.cover h1 small {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 7px;

    font-size: .47em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;

    color: #64758a;
}

.cover-description {
    max-width: 840px;

    margin: 30px 0 0;

    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #4b5968;
}

.cover-form {
    margin-top: 42px;

    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ea;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ea;
}

.cover-form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;

    min-height: 56px;

    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e7ed;
}

.cover-form-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
}

.cover-form-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;

    padding: 13px 17px;

    background: rgba(246,248,251,.8);

    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #657589;
}

.cover-form-value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;

    padding: 12px 17px;
}

.cover-org {
    margin-top: 48px;

    text-align: right;

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;

    color: var(--navy);
}


/* =========================================================
   06. QUICK INDEX
========================================================= */

.quick-index {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 24px;

    background: #fff;

    border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
    border-radius: 20px;

    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.quick-index-title {
    margin-bottom: 14px;

    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--navy);
}

.quick-index-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
}

.quick-index a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;

    min-width: 0;

    padding: 9px 11px;

    border: 1px solid #e1e6ed;
    border-radius: 10px;

    background: #fafbfd;

    text-decoration: none;

    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #536173;
}

.quick-index a:hover {
    background: #f1f5fa;
    color: var(--navy);
}

.quick-index .idx {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;

    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex: 0 0 24px;

    border-radius: 7px;

    background: var(--blue-light);

    color: #527fb0;

    font-size: 9px;
}


/* =========================================================
   07. SECTION
========================================================= */

.section {
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding: 44px 48px 48px;

    background: #fff;

    border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
    border-radius: 24px;

    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.section-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;

    margin-bottom: 29px;
    padding-bottom: 19px;

    border-bottom: 2px solid #e7ebf0;
}

.section-number {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;

    width: 43px;
    height: 43px;
    flex: 0 0 43px;

    border-radius: 13px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, #294969, #587da5);

    color: #fff;

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 900;

    box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(41,73,105,.16);
}

.section-heading h2 {
    margin: 1px 0 3px;

    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.38;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;

    color: var(--navy);
}

.section-heading p {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8290a0;
}

.intro-text {
    margin: 0 0 23px;

    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #465666;
}


/* =========================================================
   08. TITLES
========================================================= */

.sub-title {
    position: relative;

    margin: 32px 0 15px;
    padding-left: 14px;

    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: #304760;
}

.sub-title::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;

    left: 0;
    top: .2em;

    width: 4px;
    height: 1.18em;

    border-radius: 999px;

    background: #658fba;
}

.mini-title {
    margin: 23px 0 10px;

    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: #425971;
}


/* =========================================================
   09. NUMBER LIST
========================================================= */

.number-list {
    list-style: none;

    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;

    counter-reset: num;
}

.number-list > li {
    position: relative;

    min-height: 40px;

    margin-bottom: 9px;
    padding: 11px 14px 11px 49px;

    border: 1px solid #e1e6ed;
    border-radius: 11px;

    background: #fafbfd;

    font-size: 13.5px;
}

.number-list > li::before {
    counter-increment: num;
    content: counter(num);

    position: absolute;

    left: 12px;
    top: 10px;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;

    width: 25px;
    height: 25px;

    border-radius: 8px;

    background: #e6eef7;

    color: #456e99;

    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 900;
}


/* =========================================================
   10. NOTES
========================================================= */

.note {
    position: relative;

    margin: 15px 0;
    padding: 15px 18px 15px 43px;

    border: 1px solid #d8e2ec;
    border-radius: 12px;

    background: #f6f9fc;

    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.72;

    color: #4e6073;
}

.note::before {
    content: "※";

    position: absolute;

    left: 16px;
    top: 14px;

    font-weight: 900;
    color: #6384a7;
}

.notice-stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;

    margin-top: 16px;
}

.notice-line {
    position: relative;

    padding-left: 22px;

    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;

    color: #536375;
}

.notice-line::before {
    content: "※";

    position: absolute;
    left: 0;

    color: #71879e;
    font-weight: 900;
}


/* =========================================================
   11. TABLES
========================================================= */

.table-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;

    margin: 16px 0 20px;

    border-radius: 11px;
}

table {
    width: 100%;

    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;

    font-size: 12px;

    background: #fff;
}

th,
td {
    border: 1px solid #d7e0e9;

    padding: 10px 9px;

    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: middle;

    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

th {
    background: #eef3f8;

    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: #40566e;
}

td {
    color: #465667;
}

.center {
    text-align: center !important;
}

.nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.table-small {
    font-size: 10.5px;
}

.table-small th,
.table-small td {
    padding: 8px 6px;
}

.table-xsmall {
    min-width: 980px;
    font-size: 10px;
}

.table-xsmall th,
.table-xsmall td {
    padding: 7px 5px;
}


/* =========================================================
   12. EDITABLE FIELDS
========================================================= */

.editable {
    min-height: 28px;

    width: 100%;

    padding: 5px 7px;

    border-bottom: 1px dashed #9eacba;

    outline: none;

    color: #253b53;

    background: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
}

.editable:focus {
    border-bottom-color: #4f80b1;
    background: #f6f9fd;
}

.editable:empty::before {
    content: attr(data-placeholder);
    color: #a4afbb;
}

.cell-edit {
    min-height: 28px;

    outline: none;
}

.cell-edit:focus {
    background: #f5f9fd;
}

.cell-edit:empty::before {
    content: attr(data-placeholder);
    color: #bbc3cb;
}

.text-area {
    min-height: 120px;

    padding: 13px 15px;

    border: 1px solid #d9e1e9;
    border-radius: 11px;

    background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
            to bottom,
            #fff,
            #fff 29px,
            #e8edf2 30px
        );

    outline: none;

    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 30px;
}

.text-area.small {
    min-height: 80px;
}

.text-area.large {
    min-height: 170px;
}

.text-area:focus {
    border-color: #88a8c8;
}


/* =========================================================
   13. CHECKBOX
========================================================= */

.check {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;

    min-width: 22px;
    height: 22px;

    cursor: pointer;

    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;

    color: #405c78;

    user-select: none;
}

.check:hover {
    color: #2f659d;
}


/* =========================================================
   14. SUMMARY / DATA BOX
========================================================= */

.summary-box {
    margin: 17px 0;

    border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
    border-radius: 13px;

    overflow: hidden;
}

.summary-title {
    padding: 11px 15px;

    background: #edf3f8;

    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: #405872;
}

.summary-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;

    min-height: 46px;

    border-top: 1px solid #e0e6ed;
}

.summary-row > div {
    padding: 11px 14px;
}

.summary-row > div:first-child {
    background: #fafbfd;
}


/* =========================================================
   15. BULLETS
========================================================= */

.bullet-list {
    list-style: none;

    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

.bullet-list li {
    position: relative;

    margin: 5px 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
}

.bullet-list li::before {
    content: "";

    position: absolute;

    left: 2px;
    top: .72em;

    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;

    border-radius: 50%;

    background: #708fad;
}


/* =========================================================
   16. FORM META
========================================================= */

.inline-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;

    margin: 15px 0;
}

.meta-card {
    padding: 14px;

    border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
    border-radius: 11px;

    background: #fafbfd;
}

.meta-label {
    margin-bottom: 7px;

    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: #7d8b9b;
}


/* =========================================================
   17. SIGNATURE
========================================================= */

.signature-block {
    margin-top: 38px;

    text-align: center;
}

.signature-date {
    margin-bottom: 25px;

    font-size: 14px;
}

.signature-destination {
    margin-top: 28px;

    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 900;

    color: var(--navy);
}


/* =========================================================
   18. MOBILE
========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 760px) {

    .toolbar {
        padding: 10px 12px;
    }

    .toolbar-sub {
        display: none;
    }

    .btn-reset {
        display: none;
    }

    .toolbar button {
        padding: 0 12px;
        min-height: 38px;
    }

    .site-wrap {
        padding: 18px 10px 50px;
    }

    .cover {
        min-height: 0;

        padding: 48px 25px 35px;

        border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .cover h1 {
        font-size: 35px;
    }

    .cover-description {
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cover-form-row {
        grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr;
    }

    .quick-index-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .section {
        padding: 29px 20px 32px;

        border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
        font-size: 20px;
    }

    .section-number {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        flex-basis: 38px;
    }

    .inline-meta {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

}


/* =========================================================
   19. PRINT / A4
========================================================= */

@page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 13mm 12mm 15mm 12mm;
}

@media print {

    html,
    body {
        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;

        background: #fff !important;

        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
        print-color-adjust: exact !important;
    }

    body {
        font-size: 9pt;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .toolbar,
    .quick-index {
        display: none !important;
    }

    .site-wrap {
        padding: 0 !important;
    }

    .document {
        width: 100% !important;
        max-width: none !important;

        margin: 0 !important;
    }

    /* 표지 */
    .cover {
        min-height: 267mm;

        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 18mm 14mm !important;

        border: 1px solid #cad3dc !important;
        border-radius: 0 !important;

        box-shadow: none !important;

        background: #fff !important;

        page-break-after: always;
        break-after: page;
    }

    .cover::before {
        width: 3mm;
    }

    .cover h1 {
        font-size: 30pt;
    }

    .cover-description {
        font-size: 10pt;
    }

    /* 각 대항목 새 페이지 */
    .section {
        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;

        border: 0 !important;
        border-radius: 0 !important;

        box-shadow: none !important;

        page-break-before: always;
        break-before: page;
    }

    .section-heading {
        margin: 0 0 6mm !important;
        padding: 0 0 4mm !important;

        border-bottom: 1.2pt solid #bcc7d2 !important;

        page-break-after: avoid;
        break-after: avoid-page;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
        font-size: 16pt;
    }

    .section-number {
        width: 10mm;
        height: 10mm;
        flex-basis: 10mm;

        background: #eaf0f6 !important;

        border: 1pt solid #49647f;

        box-shadow: none !important;

        color: #29445f !important;
    }

    .intro-text {
        font-size: 9.2pt;
    }

    .sub-title,
    .mini-title {
        page-break-after: avoid;
        break-after: avoid-page;
    }

    .sub-title {
        margin-top: 6mm;
        font-size: 10.5pt;
    }

    /* 표 */
    table {
        font-size: 7.6pt;
    }

    th {
        font-size: 7.3pt;
        background: #eef1f4 !important;
    }

    th,
    td {
        padding: 1.8mm 1.5mm;
        border-color: #c8d1da !important;
    }

    .table-small {
        font-size: 7.2pt;
    }

    .table-xsmall {
        min-width: 0 !important;
        width: 100% !important;

        font-size: 6.5pt;
    }

    .table-xsmall th,
    .table-xsmall td {
        padding: 1.3mm 1mm;
    }

    .table-wrap {
        overflow: visible !important;
        margin: 3mm 0 4mm;
    }

    /* 행 절단 방지 */
    tr,
    .summary-row,
    .meta-card,
    .note,
    .text-area,
    .number-list > li {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
        break-inside: avoid-page;
    }

    thead {
        display: table-header-group;
    }

    tfoot {
        display: table-footer-group;
    }

    /* 입력영역 */
    .editable {
        min-height: 6mm;
        padding: 1mm 1.5mm;
    }

    .text-area {
        min-height: 28mm;

        border-color: #cbd3db !important;

        line-height: 6mm;

        background:
            repeating-linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                #fff,
                #fff 5.8mm,
                #e7eaee 6mm
            ) !important;
    }

    .text-area.small {
        min-height: 19mm;
    }

    .text-area.large {
        min-height: 38mm;
    }

    .number-list > li {
        margin-bottom: 2mm;

        padding-top: 2mm;
        padding-bottom: 2mm;

        background: #fafafa !important;
    }

    .note {
        margin: 2.5mm 0;
        padding: 2.5mm 3mm 2.5mm 9mm;

        background: #f7f8fa !important;

        font-size: 7.8pt;
    }

    .note::before {
        left: 3mm;
        top: 2.4mm;
    }

    .notice-line {
        font-size: 7.8pt;
    }

    .summary-title {
        background: #eef2f5 !important;
    }

    .summary-row > div:first-child {
        background: #fafafa !important;
    }

    .check {
        font-size: 11pt;
    }

    .signature-block {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
        break-inside: avoid-page;
    }

    a {
        color: inherit !important;
        text-decoration: none !important;
    }
}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- ======================================================
     TOOLBAR
====================================================== -->

<header class="toolbar">

    <div>
        <div class="toolbar-title">
            역곡지구 하우스토리 입찰 제안 세부현황서
        </div>

        <div class="toolbar-sub">
            웹 작성 · A4 PDF 출력 최적화
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="toolbar-actions">

        <button
            class="btn-reset"
            type="button"
            onclick="resetForm()"
        >
            작성내용 초기화
        </button>

        <button
            class="btn-print"
            type="button"
            onclick="window.print()"
        >
            PDF로 저장 / 인쇄
        </button>

    </div>

</header>



<div class="site-wrap">

<main class="document">


